                                                "sense_id": "516d9ac8-ead7-3a9e-bcb0-d2ec5bc1155f",
                                                "text": "Thou didst swear to me upon a parcel-gilt goblet […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7baa09eb-54ac-4f70-9160-008020c3c1a3",
                                                "sense_id": "516d9ac8-ead7-3a9e-bcb0-d2ec5bc1155f",
                                                "text": "[…] as the worthy dame was parcel blind and more than parcel deaf, knowledge was excluded by two principal entrances […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03585047-8ed6-4b11-9ca4-188e80301ef6",
                                                "sense_id": "516d9ac8-ead7-3a9e-bcb0-d2ec5bc1155f",
                                                "text": "here was one [a hut] that, summer-blanch’d, / Was parcel-bearded with the traveller’s-joy / In Autumn, parcel ivy-clad;"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
